OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's office advertising role
OL,4,Awith #170k salary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA regional mayor's office is looking
OL,7,Ffor a chief executive with a salary of
OL,8,Fup to #170,000.
OL,10,FIt is to replace interim boss Alan
OL,11,FMenzies, who has been in post at the
OL,12,FHull and East Yorkshire Combined
OL,13,FAuthority (HEYCA) since it was set up
OL,14,Fin 2025.
OL,16,FThe role is to act as the principal
OL,17,Fstrategic adviser to Reform UK's
OL,18,Felected mayor Luke Campbell and the
OL,19,Fexecutive board, as well as
OL,20,Frepresenting the region nationally and
OL,21,Facross the world.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
